			"notes": "**v1.0.0**\nFirst release, I spent like over a month on this.\nFeatures:\n- Items!\n  - Determination (only serves as the creative tab icon for now)\n  - Weapons!\n     - Ballet Shoes\n     - Burnt Pan\n     - Empty Gun\n     - Real Knife\n     - Torn Notebook\n     - Tough Glove\n     - Toy Knife\n     - Worn Dagger\n- Blocks!\n  - Mostly just placeholders for that one screenshot I posted a month ago. Don't expect much of them.\n\nI honestly don't know whether it would need the Fabric API or not, but download it just in case."
